From: TaterTotterson <tater@tatertotterson.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Do not also declare the static package version as dynamic

The S420 adapter supplies a fixed version and removes setuptools-scm.
PEP 621 forbids declaring the same field as both static and dynamic;
setuptools 69 rejects it before the runtime wheel can be built.

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -36,7 +36,6 @@ dependencies = [
     "bleak>=0.21.1,<2; sys_platform == 'linux'",
     "webrtc-noise-gain>=1,<2",
 ]
-dynamic = ["version"]
 
 [project.optional-dependencies]
 onnx = ["onnxruntime>=1.22,<2"]
